        "what_it_does": "ECMWF's operational AI Forecasting System — encoder-processor-decoder model comparable to GraphCast/Pangu, produced by the agency that generates ERA5/HRES reference data.",
        "how_we_use_it": "Alternative backbone if StormCast proves insufficient. Fully open CC BY 4.0 license (most permissive of all top-tier global models), and comes from the same institution producing the verification data — lowest distribution-shift risk. Use as global-scale input conditioning if we need synoptic-scale context beyond HRRR's CONUS domain.",
